cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research snapshot, cite it as a research prototype, not as a validated physical inference system. Copyright 2026 Inceptless. The Apache-2.0 licence field applies to software code; documentation is confirmed CC BY 4.0 and synthetic evidence is confirmed CC0 1.0 by the maintainer."
title: "PhainoWeave Research — Reproducible Physical Inference Studies"
version: "0.1.0-research"
date-released: 2026-11-07
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/haeliotang/phainoweave-research"
authors:
  - family-names: "Tang"
    given-names: "Haelio"
    affiliation: "Inceptless"
abstract: >-
  Synthetic studies, frozen protocols, negative results, and minimal
  reproduction code for a verifiable physical-world inference research
  program. The snapshot contains no real bench data and makes no claim of
  real-world physical inference capability.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - physical inference
  - identifiability
  - negative results
  - research software
